body:
Note for anyone cherry picking this commit to fix your game.  This block is broken.

It erases the node in like 492, then continues to use it below... which causes bad global_offset values being inserted into the free_blocks_by_offset.  My fix was:

```
		// Connects to the next block.
		auto value = next->value;
		remove_from_size_map(value);
		free_blocks_by_offset.erase(value.global_offset);

		value.global_offset -= p_result.count;
		value.size += p_result.count;

		DEV_ASSERT(!free_blocks_by_offset.has(value.global_offset));
		new_block = free_blocks_by_offset.insert(value.global_offset, value);
```

